sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant RAM as RAM API
  participant Redis as Redis Enterprise
  participant OpenAI as OpenAI API

  Client->>RAM: GET /session-memory/{sessionId}
  RAM->>Redis: read session JSON
  Redis-->>RAM: events
  RAM-->>Client: session memory

  Client->>RAM: POST /long-term-memory/search
  RAM->>OpenAI: create query embedding
  OpenAI-->>RAM: embedding vector
  RAM->>Redis: vector search
  Redis-->>RAM: memory records
  RAM-->>Client: search results
